WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.770
In the summer of 1915,

2
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:10.363
six Armenian villages below Musa Dagh
received the order for deportation.

3
00:00:10.403 --> 00:00:14.213
More than 4,000 people
drove their flocks up the mountain

4
00:00:14.253 --> 00:00:15.635
and dug in.

5
00:00:15.675 --> 00:00:17.205
They held for 53 days,

6
00:00:17.245 --> 00:00:20.789
and sewed two great banners
to call for rescue.

7
00:00:21.029 --> 00:00:22.479
French ships saw the signals,

8
00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:26.716
and carried about 4,000 Armenians
to Port Said.

9
00:00:26.956 --> 00:00:30.251
Hold Musa Dagh until the ships come.

